  7: ```mermaid
  8: flowchart TD
  9:     C[Level catalog] --> V[Static validator]
 10:     C --> E[Pure puzzle engine]
 11:     E --> R[React runtime adapter]
 12:     E --> S[Hybrid solver]
 13:     E --> A[Difficulty analyzer]
 14:     E --> H[Hint selector]
