66: - Every finding has a resolution entry.
67: - Every confirmed redundant item is removed.
68: - Every retained item has proof.
69: - Current `npm run typecheck`, `npm test`, and `npm run build` pass after cleanup, unless a pre-existing failure is captured before cleanup and proven unrelated.
70: - No unrelated dirty file is overwritten or reverted.
71: - The resolution file explicitly states that the triage scope is frozen.
72: 
73: ## Stop rule
74: 
75: If the skill is unavailable, its instructions cannot be read, or its analysis cannot run, stop the entire assignment with `GOAL_BLOCKED`. Do not substitute a guessed manual command and claim compliance.
