 12: - forward cells in all four directions.
 13: - forward ordering nearest-to-farthest.
 14: - multi-cell full leading edge in all four directions.
 15: 
 16: ## Occupancy
 17: 
 18: - live unit occupies cells.
 19: - escaped unit ignored.
 20: - obstacle occupies cells.
 21: - closed gate occupies cells.
 22: - open gate ignored.
 23: - switch ignored as a blocker.
 24: - multi-cell map includes every cell.
 25: 
 26: ## Domain exit transitions
 27: 
 28: - clear exit accepted.
 29: - blocked by unit.
 30: - blocked by obstacle.
 31: - blocked by closed gate.
 32: - passes open gate.
 33: - escaped target rejected.
 34: - missing target rejected.
 35: - obstacle target rejected.
 36: - gate target rejected.
 37: - switch target rejected.
 38: - rejected action does not mutate input.
 39: - accepted exit removes occupancy.
 40: - one switch crossed.
 41: - multiple switches crossed.
 42: - switch not crossed.
 43: - blocked exit does not activate switch.
 44: - target gate opens atomically.
 45: - gate remains open.
 46: - win detected after last unit.
