 49: ## Rotate transitions
 50: 
 51: - up to right.
 52: - right to down.
 53: - down to left.
 54: - left to up.
 55: - consumes exactly one charge.
 56: - zero charge rejected.
 57: - missing target rejected without charge loss.
 58: - environmental target rejected without charge loss.
 59: - escaped unit rejected without charge loss.
