<file path="doc/goal/quality/02_COMMANDS_AND_QUALITY_GATES.md">
 1: # Commands and Release Quality Gates
 2: 
 3: ## Required commands
 4: 
 5: Run from `/home/pro/Downloads/intern/11_Escape`:
 6: 
 7: ```bash
 8: npm install
 9: npm run typecheck
10: npm test
